It's been a short time today, but enjoy yourselves!  Yay!

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:15.360
Yay!

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:23.580
They're coming out!

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.980
It's Capeta!

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:25.750
Huh?

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:37.190
It looks like Komazawa-kun's machine was all right.

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:38.800
That's good.

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:40.300
Just as I thought!

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:42.330
That car is different from yesterday's!

00:13:43.310 --> 00:13:46.270
Capeta's car is the spare car!

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:51.650
First check the behavior of the car.

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:54.150
If you think there's something wrong, come back straight away.

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:55.360
Whatever you do, don't push yourself.

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:56.360
<b>Yes.</b>

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:05.980
<i>Looks good.</i>

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.850
<i>The engine is running well.</i>

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:08.770
<i>With this...</i>

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.600
<i>I-It won't turn!</i>

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:33.560
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.570
<i>Turn!</i>

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:45.790
<i>With this extreme understeer, I can't drive properly.</i>

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:50.890
He's still new and he's the second driver...

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:53.810
That's why the ace took his car.

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:54.960
No way.

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:58.080
This is the reality of the pros.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:02.680
If you want favorable treatment,
 the only thing you can do is get results.

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:07.770
But how can he get results if they give him a weird car to drive?

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:10.190
But he still has to do it!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:13.860
<i>Like his first win in the kart.</i>

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:16.150
<i>He has to make the impossible a reality!</i>

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:22.490
<i>Do your best, Capeta!</i>

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:25.830
<i>Up until now, you've gone over many walls like this.</i>

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:30.330
<i>If it's you... you can do it this time, too...</i>

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:47.230
<b>There's no problem with the engine.</b>

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:49.810
<b>But the handling is not stable.</b>

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:50.690
Okay, I got it.

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:51.600
Let's make adjustments.

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.810
And if we raise the wings,
there would be more downforce...

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:56.770
<b>No, please keep them rested.</b>

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:58.780
You won't be able to turn the corners!

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:00.780
<b>I'll do something about the corners.</b>

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:06.910
<b>But since the engine is running well, please adjust the settings to enhance the top speed.</b>

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:09.780
All right.

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:11.740
<i>That machine.</i>

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.990
<i>Just as I thought, it can't run properly.</i>

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:15.960
<i>That doesn't matter!</i>

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:17.170
<i>I'm the ace!</i>

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:20.170
<i>My job is to drive the fastest machine and win!</i>

