00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:42.860
Apparently Monami's friend is competing in the Formula something.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.430
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:42.860
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:45.150
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:44.320
It's Taira.

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:47.050
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:49.000
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:53.680
Come to think of it, Ada-chan was saying, "It would be sad if Taira left the kart."

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.950
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:52.840
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:54.770
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:54.970
I see.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:56.000
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:56.000
So Taira is...

00:16:56.530 --> 00:17:01.980
Come to think of it, I also found you at that Haruna race that Taira competed in.

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:58.630
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:00.500
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:02.450
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:04.820
Maybe it was fate.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.350
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:06.170
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:06.550
Okay.

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:08.200
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:07.930
I'll drive you there.

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:10.470
I'll bring the car over, Monami-chan.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.060
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:11.960
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:12.310
No.  I won't go.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:14.090
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:14.980
Monami?

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:15.890
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:17.840
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:18.920
Ca-chan will be fine even if I don't come.

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.920
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:20.700
He'll win!

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:21.690
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:23.650
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.150
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:27.610
I can't leave all those people who are waiting for me.

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:27.610
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore—

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:29.580
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore—

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.520
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore—

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.670
Encore!  Encore!  Encore!  Encore—

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:35.900
<b>I'm going to sing another song!</b>

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:46.910
<b>The formation lap has now started.</b>

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:51.460
<b>The final of the Formula Stellar 6th race will start momentarily.</b>

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:59.050
<b>In the front row, it's Komazawa from Persec Motorsports and Ishihara from Sam's.</b>

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:04.700
<b>We worried that Komazawa might be injured from his crash in yesterday's qualifier after getting the pole,</b>

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.140
<b>but today he's showing energy.</b>

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:10.820
<b>In the second row we have Shiba from Sam's and Hata Noriko from Hata Racing.</b>

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:12.800
<b>Following behind them,</b>

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:19.680
<b>in 5th place we have Taira Capeta from Persec, a 16-year-old driver in his debut race today.</b>

00:18:22.920 --> 00:18:24.840
Will Capeta be all right?

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:27.480
Resting his wings like that.

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:31.010
Why did he go for a setting that will lower the grip?

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:35.670
There they are!

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:37.480
Shige-san!  Nobu!

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:39.880
Kumada-san!

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:41.230
So you came.

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:45.180
Yeah.  But it's not just me this time.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.100
Oh wow!

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.490
It's amazing!

00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:54.240
Wow.  The international circuit sure is big.

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:56.410
The paving work would be hard.

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:58.200
That's a good road surface.

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.350
They're maintaining it well.

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:03.120
There's no complaining on the kid's big day.

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:11.800
But the sound of those things called formula cars is quite different from go-karts.

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.360
Boss...  Everyone.

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.690
Boss...  Everyone.

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:16.810
Th-Thank you!

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.730
Don't tell me...

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:24.910
Hey.  It's been a while.

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:26.190
Momotarou!

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:30.490
I'm sorry I couldn't be any help back then, Andou-kun.

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:32.320
Back then?

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:38.910
Had I not been away from home,
 I could have lent you a formula car or two.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:44.420
<i>Oh yeah.  I did ask something like that.</i>

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:48.920
But from the looks of things, he didn't need any help.

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:52.700
He came this far with his own strength.

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:55.930
Just as I expected from my eternal rival!

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:03.980
Go!  Go!  Ca-pe-ta!

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:02.740
Capeta-nii-chan!

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:03.980
Do your best!

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:16.870
<i>I'll be watching with my own eyes, Taira Capeta.</i>

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:19.370
<i>That driving you showed us on the kart.</i>

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:55.540
<i>The settings still aren't perfect, but let's think of a way you could drive faster, together.</i>

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:56.990
<i>Our driving!</i>

00:22:50.980 --> 00:22:53.340
He's starting from the 5th grid in a spare car?!

00:22:53.340 --> 00:22:55.070
That doesn't matter!

00:22:55.070 --> 00:22:57.690
He has to take the top, no matter what!

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:00.110
Ca-chan!  Do your best!

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:01.950
Next time, on Capeta.

00:23:01.950 --> 00:23:03.160
Red Zone!

00:23:03.160 --> 00:23:05.110
Open up the future!
